_5if6.pdf","page_label":"file page 64, lines 13-13"}]},{"heading":"How the case got here","paragraphs":["The Supreme Court heard oral argument in this case on March 26, 2013."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 3, lines 7-15","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2012/12-144_5if6.pdf","page_label":"file page 3, lines 7-15"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 64, lines 15-17","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2012/12-144_5if6.pdf","page_label":"file page 64, lines 15-17"}]},{"heading":"What each side wants","paragraphs":["the sides that brought the case want the Court to allow a state official to defend the measure.","the opposing sides want the Court to dismiss the appeal for lack of standing."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 28, lines 33-7","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2012/12-144_5if6.pdf","page_label":"file page 28, lines 33-7"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 3, lines 17-27","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2012/12-144_5if6.pdf","page_label":"file page 3, lines 17-27"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 50, lines 23-29","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2012/12-144_5if6.pdf","page_label":"file page 50, lines 23-29"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 57, lines 7-25","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2012/12-144_5if6.pdf","page_label":"file page 57, lines 7-25"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 64, lines 13-13","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2012/12-144_5if6.pdf","page_label":"file page 64, lines 13-13"}]},{"heading":"What each side says","paragraphs":["the sides that brought the case argue the official has a personal interest in the law.","the opposing sides argue the state must authorize any defense of its laws."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 28, lines 33-7","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2012/12-144_5if6.pdf","page_label":"file page 28, lines 33-7"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 3, lines 17-27","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2012/12-144_5if6.pdf","page_label":"file page 3, lines 17-27"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 50, lines 23-29","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2012/12-144_5if6.pdf","page_label":"file page 50, lines 23-29"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 57, lines 7-25","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2012/12-144_5if6.pdf","page_label":"file page 57, lines 7-25"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 64, lines 13-13","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2012/12-144_5if6.pdf","page_label":"file page 64, lines 13-13"}]},{"heading":"What the justices asked","paragraphs":["Justice Kagan asked if a state can assign defense rights to any citizen.","Justice Scalia asked if the attorney general has a proprietary interest."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 3, lines 29-33","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/